0..52 Comment "//! This source writes a magma corolla path by hand."
53..56 Comment "//!"
57..134 Comment "//! `ua[1, 4]` derives a path over the magma\'s corollas. The hand path starts"
135..213 Comment "//! with unit reflexivity and nests one `equiv` for each corolla. Its directed"
214..260 Comment "//! twin has one `Flow.into` for each corolla."
261..264 Comment "//!"
265..343 Comment "//! The module checks conversion between the hand and derived paths. Transport"
344..420 Comment "//! and a ride move the binary corolla\'s boolean. A reverse ride is refused."
421..424 Comment "//!"
425..498 Comment "//! - see: `pathological/higher-cells/ua-by-hand-unnatural.gandr` — the"
499..554 Comment "//!   naturality `ua` checks beyond the hand definition"
555..635 Comment "//! - see: `ua-corolla-strata.gandr` — the Segal certification from degree two"
636..711 Comment "//! - cites: [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]"
712..791 Comment "//! - cites: [Gratzer-2026-directed_univalence_simplicial_homotopy_type_theory]"
792..795 Comment "//!"
796..972 Comment "//! [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]: https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129514000565 \"Shulman, Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity\""
973..1169 Comment "//! [Gratzer-2026-directed_univalence_simplicial_homotopy_type_theory]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.09146 \"Gratzer, Weinberger and Buchholtz, Directed univalence in simplicial homotopy type theory\""
1171..1225 Comment "// This import supplies the magma and its translators."
